            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2:19",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Au alikuwa ameajiriwa kama msimamizi.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " mlangoni pa mfalme. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esta alikuwa hajadhihirisha jamaa yake wala kabila yake, kama vile Mordekai alivyomwagiza; kwa maana Esta alikuwa akiyashika maagizo ya Mordekai, vile vile kama wakati alipolelewa naye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikawa siku zile, Mordekai alipokuwa akiketi mlangoni pa mfalme, wawili kati ya matowashi wake mfalme, Bigthana na Tereshi, waliolinda milango ya vyumba vya mfalme, walikasirika sana, wakataka kumwua mfalme Ahasuero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
